  "fields": {
    "title": "Grid",
    "textContent": {
      "nodeType": "document",
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "nodeType": "heading-3",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Description",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "Grid Layout, is a two-dimensional grid-based layout system that, compared to any web layout system of the past, completely changes the way user interfaces are designed. ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "3TBGoqMl1snjRBxLIzrc6Z",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "CSS ",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "has always been used to layout our web pages, but it’s never done a very good job of it. First, we used tables, then floats, positioning and inline-block, but all of these methods were essentially hacks and left out a lot of important functionality (vertical centering, for instance). ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "entry-hyperlink",
              "data": {
                "target": {
                  "sys": {
                    "id": "67Iur5SgEh006E60CLk3w4",
                    "type": "Link",
                    "linkType": "Entry"
                  }
                }
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "nodeType": "text",
                  "value": "Flexbox",
                  "marks": [],
                  "data": {}
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": " is also a very great layout tool, but its one-directional flow has different use cases — and they actually work together quite well! Grid is the very first CSS module created specifically to solve the layout problems we’ve all been hacking our way around for as long as we’ve been making websites.",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "CSS Grid is a two-dimensional grid-based layout system and can be compared to the baseline grid and document grid from the layout program InDesign. ",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "nodeType": "paragraph",
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "nodeType": "text",
              "value": "",
              "marks": [],
              "data": {}
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "codeField": {
      "data": {},
      "content": [
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "value": "css\n<!-- Grid Container -->\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"item item-1\"> </div>\n  <div class=\"item item-2\"> </div>\n  <div class=\"item item-3\"> </div>\n</div>",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "data": {},
          "content": [
            {
              "data": {},
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "value": "css\n<!-- Grid Item -->\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"item\"> </div>\n  <div class=\"item\">\n    <p class=\"sub-item\"> </p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"item\"> </div>\n</div>",
              "nodeType": "text"
            }
          ],
          "nodeType": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
